"section-heading night center">We would love to hear about your safari plans.</h2></div><div class="contact-info-text-wrap"><p class="about-text">Choose the way that suits you best. Our local team is ready to help with safari packages, day tours and trip enquiries.</p></div></div><div class="contact-cards"><div class="contact-card"><div class="contact-card-top"><div class="contact-icon-circle"><svg aria-hidden="true" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="contact-icon contact-icon"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"></path></svg></div><div class="contact-card-text"><p class="contact-card-eyebrow">Call us</p><div class="contact-card-title">+263 712 154 201</div><p class="contact-card-note">Contact us to confirm opening hours</p></div></div><a href="tel:+263712154201" class="contact-card-action w-inline-block"><div>Call now</div><div class="contact-action-arrow">→</div></a></div><div class="contact-card contact-card-blue"><div class="contact-card-top"><div class="contact-icon-circle circle-light"><svg aria-hidden="true" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="contact-icon contact-icon"><rect rx="2" height="16" width="20" y="4" x="2"></rect><path d="m22 7-10 6L2 7"></path></svg></div><div class="contact-card-text"><p class="contact-card-eyebrow eyebrow-light">Email us</p><h3 class="contact-card-title title-light">info@cuckoosafaris.com</h3><p class="contact-card-note note-light">Ask us about current tour availability</p></div></div><a href="mailto:info@cuckoosafaris.com" class="contact-card-action action-light w-inline-block"><div>Send email</div><div class="contact-action-arrow arrow-light">→</div></a></div><div class="contact-card"><div class="contact-card-top"><div class="contact-icon-circle"><svg aria-hidden="true" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="contact-icon contact-icon"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"></path><circle r="3" cy="10" cx="12"></circle></svg></div><div class="contact-card-text"><p class="contact-card-eyebrow">Visit us</p><div class="contact-card-title">5839 MKhosana, Victoria Falls</div><p class="contact-card-note">Zimbabwe</p></div></div><a href="https://maps.google.com/?q=5839%20MKhosana%2C%20Victoria%20Falls%2C%20Zimbabwe" rel="noopener" class="contact-card-action w-inline-block"><div>Get directions</div><div class="contact-action-arrow">→</div></a></div><div class="contact-card"><div class="contact-card-top"><div class="contact-icon-circle"><svg aria-hidden="true" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="contact-icon contact-icon"><circle r="10" cy="12" cx="12"></circle><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path></svg></div><div class="contact-card-text"><p class="contact-card-eyebrow">Support hours</p><div class="contact-card-title">Contact us to confirm opening hours</div><p class="contact-card-note">Hours may vary by season</p></div></div><a href="#office" class="contact-card-action w-inline-block"><div>View schedule</div><div class="contact-action-arrow">→</div></a></div></div></div></section><section id="office" class="section"><div class="space-8-small"></div><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container"><div class="contact-office-row"><div class="contact-map"><svg aria-hidden="true" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" viewBox="0 0 760 560" xm