v></div><h2 class="contact-office-title">Visit our Victoria Falls base.</h2><p class="about-text">Contact our Victoria Falls team to talk through safari routes, day tours and trip options.</p></div><div class="contact-hours"><div class="contact-hours-row"><p class="contact-hours-text">Monday – Friday</p><p class="contact-hours-text value-medium">9:00 am – 6:00 pm</p></div><div class="contact-hours-row"><p class="contact-hours-text">Saturday</p><p class="contact-hours-text value-medium">10:00 am – 4:00 pm</p></div><div class="contact-hours-row"><p class="contact-hours-text">Sunday</p><p class="contact-hours-text value-blue">Contact us to confirm opening hours</p></div></div><a data-wf--primary-button--variant="with-border" data-wf-component-id="b1f5f4f7-681d-fd69-fc1c-e7dcb33d6009" data-wf-variant-state="b04b30b8-312c-20b6-324a-d08432c0f8eb" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=5839%20MKhosana%2C%20Victoria%20Falls%2C%20Zimbabwe" target="_blank" class="primary-button w-variant-b04b30b8-312c-20b6-324a-d08432c0f8eb w-inline-block"><div class="button-item-main"><div class="button-text-pill"><div class="primay-button-text _01">Get Directions</div><div class="primay-button-text _02">Get Directions</div></div><div class="button-arrow-pill"><div class="arrow-wrapper"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 21 21" fill="none" class="button-arrow"><path d="M3.5 9.625V11.375H14V13.125H15.75V11.375H17.5V9.625H15.75V7.875H14V9.625H3.5ZM12.25 6.125H14V7.875H12.25V6.125ZM12.25 6.125H10.5V4.375H12.25V6.125ZM12.25 14.875H14V13.125H12.25V14.875ZM12.25 14.875H10.5V16.625H12.25V14.875Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 21 21" fill="none" class="button-arrow"><path d="M3.5 9.625V11.375H14V13.125H15.75V11.375H17.5V9.625H15.75V7.875H14V9.625H3.5ZM12.25 6.125H14V7.875H12.25V6.125ZM12.25 6.125H10.5V4.375H12.25V6.125ZM12.25 14.875H14V13.125H12.25V14.875ZM12.25 14.875H10.5V16.625H12.25V14.875Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div><div class="button-animated-color"></div></div></a></div></div></div><div class="space-8-small"></div></section><section id="Contact" data-wf-component-id="0da338ce-8a2f-b511-6f44-29571178f774" data-wf-variant-state="base" class="section"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container"><div class="contact-wrapper"><div class="space-3-normal"></div><div class="w-layout-grid contact-grid"><div class="contact-left"><div class="contact-content-wrapper"><div class="max-width-17"><h3 class="contact-title">Ready to plan a journey that feels truly yours?</h3></div><div class="max-width-20"><p class="font-1-extra-small">From Victoria Falls day tours to multi-day safaris, our team can help you plan the details of your trip.</p></div></div><div class="contact-image-wrapper"><img loading="lazy" src="https://lirp.cdn-website.com/e6c865a4/dms3rep/multi/opt/Lion+under+a+thunderstorm-1920w.JPG" alt="Lion on the African savannah beneath a stormy sky" sizes="100vw" class="contact-image"/></div></div><div class="contact-right"><div class="contact-form-block w-form"><form id="email-form" name="email-form" data-name="Email Form" method="get" class="contact-form" data-wf-page-id="6ac5dccc9af6b5443ef5518f" data-wf-element-id="0da338ce-8a2f-b511-6f44-29571178f784"><div class="field-block"><div class="field-wrapper"><label for="name" class="contact-field-text">Name</label><input class="contact-text-fifeld w-input" maxlength="256" name="name" data-name="Name" placeholder="Enter your name" type="text" id="name"/></div><div class="field-wrapper"><label for="Last-Name" class="contact-field-text">Last Name*</label><input class="contact-text-fifeld w-input" maxlength="256" name="Last-Name" data-name="Last Name" placeholder="Enter your last name" type="text" id="Last-Name"/></div></div><div class="field-block"><div class="field-wrapper"><label for="Travel-Dat" class="contact-field-text">Travel Date*</label><select id="Travel-Dat" name="Travel-Dat" data-name="Travel Dat" class="contact-text-fifeld w-select"><option value="">00/00/0000</option><option value="First">June 30, 2026</option><option value="Second">July 15, 2026</option><option value="Third">August 22, 2026</option></select></div><div class="field-wrapper"><label for="Email" class="contact-field-text">Work Email*</label><input class="contact-text-fifeld w-input" maxlength="256" name="Email" data-name="Email" placeholder="example@company.com" type="email" id="Email" required=""/></div></div><div class="field-block"><div class="field-wrapper"><label for="Trip-Types" class="contact-field-text">Trip Types*</label><select id="Trip-Types" name="Trip-Types" data-name="Trip Types" class="contact-text-fifeld w-select"><option value="">Choose your selected trip</option><option value="First">Victoria Falls Day Tour</option><option value="Second">Multi-day Safari</option><option value="Third">Family Safari</option></select></div><div class="field-wrapper"><label for="Estimated-Budget" class="contact-field-text">Estimated Budget*</label><select id="Estimated-Budget" name="Estimated-Budget" data-name="Estimated Budget" class="contact-text-fifeld w-select"><option value="">Select one...</option><option value="First">1000$-1200$</option><option value="Second">1100$-1500$</option><option value="Third">1200$-1500$</option></select></div></div><div class="field-block"><div class="field-wrapper"><label for="field" class="contact-field-text">Message</label><textarea id="field" name="field" maxlength="5000" data-name="Field" placeholder="Tell us more about your needs..." class="text-area w-input"></textarea></div></div><div class="submit-button-wrapper field-block"><input type="submit" data-wait="Please wait..." class="submit-button w-button" value="Book a Consultation"/></div></form><div class="success-message w-form-done"><div>Thank you! Your submission has been received!</div></div><div class="error-message w-form-fail"><div>Oops! Something went wrong while submitting the form.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="space-8-small"></div></section></div><section data-wf-component-id="0343b5af-13a1-d90a-443e-13e813ac2230" data-wf-variant-state="base" class="section footer"><div class="space-6-large"></div><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container"><div class="footer-main"><div class="footer-nav-wrapper"><div class="footer-navigation"><a href="index.html" class="footer-link">Home</a><a href="about.html" class="footer-link">About</a><a href="destination.html" class="footer-link">Day Tours</a><a href="package.html" class="footer-link">Safaris</a><a href="contact.html" aria-current="page" class="footer-link w--current">Contact</a></div></div><div class="space-1-large"></div><div class="footer-title-wrapper"><a href="mailto:info@cuckoosafaris.com" class="email-address">info@cuckoosafaris.com</a><div class="footer-social-block"><a href="https://facebook.com/Cuckoosafari/" target="_blank" class="footer-soical-wrapper w-inline-block"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="footer-social-icon"><path d="M13.397 20.9972V12.8012H16.162L16.573 9.59225H13.397V7.54825C13.397 6.62225 13.655 5.98825 14.984 5.98825H16.668V3.12725C15.8487 3.03874 15.0251 2.99634 14.201 3.00025C11.757 3.00025 10.079 4.49225 10.079 7.23125V9.58625H7.33203V12.7952H10.085V20.9972H13.397Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><div class="footer-social-text">Facebook</div></a><a href="https://instagram.com/cuckoo_safari_/?hl=en" target="_blank" class="footer-soical-wrapper w-inline-block"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" class="footer-social-icon"><path d="M6.667 10C6.667 9.56224 6.75322 9.12876 6.92075 8.72433C7.08827 8.31989 7.33382 7.9524 7.64336 7.64286C7.9529 7.33332 8.32039 7.08777 8.72482 6.92025C9.12926 6.75272 9.56274 6.6665 10.0005 6.6665C10.4383 6.6665 10.8717 6.75272 11.2762 6.92025C11.6806 7.08777 12.0481 7.33332 12.3576 7.64286C12.6672 